This license covers the paperkit wrapper: styles/paperkit.sty, the Makefile,
the template files (main.tex, sections/, references.bib), and the placeholder
logo.

It does NOT cover the conference style files bundled for convenience:

  styles/icml2026.sty, styles/icml2026.bst   -- ICML
  styles/neurips_2026.sty, neurips_2025.sty  -- NeurIPS

Those remain the property of their respective conferences and are redistributed
here only so the template compiles out of the box. Always download the current
year's official style file from the conference before submitting.

figures/ara-logo.png is the ARA Labs mark and is not covered by the MIT grant.
